version 0.5.56
previous 0.5.55
- Photos, screenshots and app downloads show up in Gallery again after sign-in: signing in no longer rewrites the media storage's database.
- A health check notices when the media storage stops answering and offers to restart it.
- Your default apps (browser, phone, assistant and others) and your pinned home-screen shortcuts follow you to every phone.
- Your data shows a running save's stage, progress and start time.
- Automatic saves run every 15 minutes by default, and only when something has changed.
- After you create a profile with Google Play on, a card helps you finish setting up Google Play.
